          "version": "1.0.5",
          "description": "DISCLAIMER, READ ME FIRST:\n\nBefore you continue and install this version, make sure you delete the SAA weapon, SAA Magazine, SAA Ammo pack and the SAA rounds from your inventory. The ids of the weapon has been updated to use MongoID, this is due to how BSG have enforced MongoID on some parts (Ammo, weapon Preset, loose loot spawn point. Have been identified to use MongoID). This is to avoid future problem where BSG decided to enforce more MongoID. If your profile is stuck at loading into the main menu then you did not properly delete the item. Make sure to set \"removeModItemsFromProfile\" To true inside Aki\\_Data\\\\Server\\\\configs\\\\core.json, this should delete the bad item that came from the mod.  \n  \n~Updated Id to use MongoID  \n~Fix looseloot for SAA not spawning because of ID issue",
